### Page 1 of 1

```text
1
NOTICE OF PUBLIC HEARING
Notice is hereby given that the Governing Body of the City of Cheyenne will, on October 28,
2013, at 6:00 p.m., in City Council Chambers, 2101 O’Neil Avenue, Cheyenne, Wyoming,
conduct a public hearing to hear public comments regarding whether the Mayor and the City
Clerk of the City of Cheyenne should be authorized to file an application for grant and/or loan
funds under the Wyoming Business Council Business Read Community Grant and Loan
Program for funding for the construction of a rail spur within the Swan Ranch Industrial Park,
located generally west of Interstate 25 and south of Interstate 80, Cheyenne, Laramie County,
Wyoming.  The public is invited to attend and participate.
```
